---
layout: default
---
{%- comment -%}
  The home page, a deck of blocks: first screen, about, research, news, contact (each in _includes/site/home/).
  Text comes from _pages/about.md and _data/*.yml; nothing is written in the blocks but labels.
  The variables assigned here are used by the blocks.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign profile = site.data.profile -%}
{%- assign areas = site.data.research -%}
{%- assign year_now = site.time | date: '%Y' | plus: 0 -%}
{%- assign month_now = site.time | date: '%m' | plus: 0 -%}
{%- assign paras = content | split: '</p>' -%}
{%- assign count_words = 'No,One,Two,Three,Four,Five,Six,Seven,Eight,Nine,Ten,Eleven,Twelve' | split: ',' -%}
{%- comment -%} The blocks are the stops of a deck: the page moves from one to the next (kit-snap). {%- endcomment -%}
<div class="home" data-kit="snap" data-snap-mode="deck">
  {% include site/home/hero.liquid %}
  {% include site/home/about.liquid %}
  {% include site/home/research.liquid %}
  {% if page.announcements and page.announcements.enabled %}{% include site/home/news.liquid %}{% endif %}
  {% include site/home/contact.liquid %}
</div>
